  "description": "A demon shaped like a flower. Piany continued fighting the Agni Empire's troops in her demonic form, until something her opponent said made her regain her composure. The great power she had gained thanks to the demon crystals had concentrated in the shape of a gorgeous flower, which gifted her with overwhelming demonic energy that could ultimately bring about her own destruction. Once Piany realized this, she made a conscious effort to calm her demonic instincts before advancing towards her enemy, who wielded a sword of fire.",
